<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Frost Mage DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 2 Pre-Raid. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, professions, boe gear and reputation rewards.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c8">Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear for Frost Mage DPS in Phase 2</span></h2>The gearing path for a frost mage should be to get hit capped, crit capped while buffed with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83074/fingers-of-frost">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_wintersgrasp.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fingers of Frost</span></a>, and then everything else into haste rating.<br/>Following that, use a mix of red <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52207/brilliant-inferno-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Inferno Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Inferno Ruby</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52217/veiled-demonseye">
<img alt="Veiled Demonseye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Demonseye</span></a> on blues, and either <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52239/potent-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Potent Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Potent Ember Topaz</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52208/reckless-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Reckless Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ember Topaz</span></a> on their gem sockets. Which one to pick for the yellow socket depends on whether you've gotten near the critical strike cap or not.<br/>
<br/>The critical strike cap is 33% since <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83074/fingers-of-frost">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_wintersgrasp.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fingers of Frost</span></a> triples the critical strike chance whenever active - this means you want at most 20,3% critical strike chance from gear (19.3% as a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_worgen_male.gif");'>Worgen</span>)<br/>
<br/>Mastery tends to perform pretty badly for frost mage, so don't bother with it unless the alternative options just don't exist. If you have to take an item with said stat, reforge it into a relevant previously mentioned stat as shown below.<br/>
<br/>
