<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head">Head for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59449/lightweight-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is the best in slot headpiece, not only is it higher item level, but also allows for customization of the secondary stats. This requires engineering but since this is the best profession by far for everyone, this should be a given.<br/>Otherwise, just get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69577/collar-of-bones">
