<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> vendor and is also the first item you should get with that currency since it helps enable the tier 11 set bonuses and is further upgradable.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
