<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands">Hands for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60247/firelords-gloves">
<img alt="Firelord's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firelord's Gloves</span></a> are the recommended pre-raid best in slot since they're very easy to obtain without any RNG component just by farming the needed currency via RDF.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: Now in cataclysm you can use both a tinker and an enchanter, so use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> combined with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52749/enchant-gloves-haste">
<img alt="Enchant Gloves - Haste" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Haste</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif");'>Engineering</span> is highly recommended as a <span class="c8">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_mage.gif");'>Mage</span></span> profession.</div></div>
