<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist">Waist for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>Because mages should be tailoring anyways, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54503/dreamless-belt">
<img alt="Dreamless Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamless Belt</span></a> is an easy recommendation - it's also possible to just buy it and it's not very expensive.<br/>If you need an alternative due to budgetary issues, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69611/sash-of-anguish">
<img alt="Sash of Anguish" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_74.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Anguish</span></a> from the new phase 2 dungeons is the best option outside of raids.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: The following enchants can be used simultaneously:<ul class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a> for an extra Gem Socket.</div></li>
