<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet">Feet for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>Not a lot of non-spirit cloth boots, thankfully, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62450/desert-walker-sandals">
<img alt="Desert Walker Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Desert Walker Sandals</span></a> are a reputation item and perform great for mage.<br/>Until you're exalted with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>, try to obtain and use the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56348/slippers-of-the-twilight-prophet">
<img alt="Slippers of the Twilight Prophet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Slippers of the Twilight Prophet</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52782/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
