<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings">Rings for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64904/ring-of-the-boy-emperor">
<img alt="Ring of the Boy Emperor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_ring-of-the-boyemperor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Boy Emperor</span></a> is a archaeology rare drop that's very grindy to obtain - if you get it, congratulations. This is a great item and pre-raid best in slot, but the delta between its alternatives is nowhere near as meaningful as with something like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> against its counterparts.<br/>
<br/>Alongside the former, I suggest obtaining the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58188/band-of-secret-names">
<img alt="Band of Secret Names" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Secret Names</span></a> from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> vendor after you've bought the three tier 11 pieces. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67129/signet-of-high-arcanist-savor">
<img alt="Signet of High Arcanist Savor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of High Arcanist Savor</span></a> performs similarly but is very expensive, while the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> only requires a few dungeons to buy.<br/>
<br/>The new 353 item level rings (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69566/shimmerclaw-band">
<img alt="Shimmerclaw Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shimmerclaw Band</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69602/signet-of-venoxis">
<img alt="Signet of Venoxis" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Venoxis</span></a>) are better than previous dungeon options, but still not as good as the previously mentioned three rings.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>BiS Ring Enchant</b>: If you are an <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif");'>Enchanter</span>- use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a>. This profession isn't recommended.</div></div>
