<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-frost-mage-dps-phase-2-pre-raid">Main-Hand Weapons for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>In general, pre-raid two handed options are just slightly better than one handed weapons. But there's still a few noteworthy items to mention here.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69591/voodoo-hexblade">
<img alt="Voodoo Hexblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Voodoo Hexblade</span></a> from the new phase 2 dungeons is a great option that's relatively easy to obtain and will allow for quicker catching up. The other weapons perform similarly amongst themselves.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
