<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-frost-mage-dps-phase-2-pre-raid">Two-Handed  Weapons for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>Here, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> is listed and the top and is the actual pre-raid best in slot. Though this is a very rare drop from archaeology so most people likely don't have it regardless of how much time they put into farming it.<br/>
<br/>The following staves are all listed in terms of performance. It's relevant to note that even though the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69624/legacy-of-arlokk">
<img alt="Legacy of Arlokk" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legacy of Arlokk</span></a> staff has worse secondary stats than the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69591/voodoo-hexblade">
<img alt="Voodoo Hexblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Voodoo Hexblade</span></a> one handed weapon, it's more likely to perform better for you because the latter would require a similar or higher item level off-hand to match.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52774/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
