<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-frost-mage-dps-phase-2-pre-raid">Off Hand Weapons for Frost Mage DPS Phase 2 Pre-Raid</h4>Very few options here, thankfully one of them has the perfect stats for frost mage. The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56306/beautys-favorite-bone">
<img alt="Beauty's Favorite Bone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Beauty's Favorite Bone</span></a> is an easy pick-up that you should get as soon as possible if you plan to use one-handed weapons.<br/>The second option is still very good, and a lot easier to get, even as soon as you hit level 85 from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, so no shame if you use that instead.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
